{"id":"657818","name":"腊肉炒茨菇","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/657818/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"茨菇","amount":"300g"},{"name":"腊肉","amount":"一块"},{"name":"蒜苗","amount":"150g"}],"sub":[{"name":"小米椒","amount":"1颗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"蒜苗、腊肉、小米椒。","img":"images/657818/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"茨菇刮去皮。","img":"images/657818/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切成厚片。","img":"images/657818/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"配菜切好。","img":"images/657818/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅烧热，放入腊肉炒出油脂。","img":"images/657818/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入茨菇翻炒。","img":"images/657818/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入清水和适量盐，焖10分钟左右。","img":"images/657818/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"开盖，放入小米椒，加入酱油。","img":"images/657818/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入蒜苗炒出香气，出锅。","img":"images/657818/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/657818/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}